  description: If a player controls 2 or more monsters of the same card type (Ritual,
    Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link), they must send some to the GY so they control
    no more than 1 monster of that card type. Then, each player that sent a monster
    to the GY for this effect draws cards equal to the number of different card types
    (Ritual, Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link) they control. You can only activate 1
    "Brutal Beast Battle" per turn.
